Add rule families: fair allocation, difficulty-aware greedy, a belief-aware index rule, and
the shortest-engagement rule (slew time plus expected dwell time, from Taylor 2021).
Add regime axes: a dwell-based load ratio, prior misspecification, and decision latency
(compute-matched comparison).
Cite the weak-baseline literature in the argument for C3.
