8. Next steps
1. You: choose the scope (benchmark plus regime analysis with explanatory variables, or
the method-heavy paper) and the venue family. Nothing else is blocking.
2. Me, if you agree: try again to locate Carr 2021 and Blickley et al. 2021 (two searches
this round did not find them), and finish Zhang from Section 4.3 and Li from Section
5.5, because they touch G1 and G2 directly. Expected result: Section 2 shows them as
