3. Pilot P0 (draft; the full specification is frozen before running). A single effector, n = 4
to 6 threats, two hardness classes with different required dwell times unknown to the
policy, a prior over classes, a breach deadline per threat and a fixed retargeting time.
Objective: threats neutralized before breach. Solve the sequential problem exactly by
dynamic programming on a discretized time grid, and compare fair allocation, shortest
